<title>USA: Orbotech Ltd stake cut by Elron.</title>
<headline>Orbotech Ltd stake cut by Elron.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Elron Electronic Industries Ltd said Wednesday it cut its stake in Orbotech Ltd to 11.88 percent or 1.5 million ordinary shares from a previous stake of 15.82 percent or two million ordinary shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with Securities and Exchange Commission, Elron said it sold 191,000 shares between Dec 23 and Jan 2. The filing did not provide the prices the shares were sold at.</p>
<p>It said Orbotech was formerly known as Optrotech Ltd.</p>
